              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "أطاع — aṭāʿa — \"to obey\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "أطاع الولد أباه وذهب إلى النوم. aṭāʿa al-walad abāhu wa-dhahaba ilā an-nawm. The boy obeyed his father and went to bed."
            },
